# UI design system

For any UI work in this repository (components, layouts, styling, new pages, shadcn usage):

1. Follow **[docs/design/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md](docs/design/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md)** — it is the **PRIMARY** design system.
2. Do **not** restyle the pixel-art **canvas** room renderer (crisp pixels, integer scale, no rounding/shadows on canvas pixels).
3. If the owner explicitly names another style for a feature, that scoped doc wins for that feature only (e.g. **[docs/design/TERMINAL.md](docs/design/TERMINAL.md)** for the in-game CRT terminal).
4. Use theme tokens in `src/app/globals.css` (colors, radii, pop shadows) rather than ad-hoc one-off colors for chrome.
5. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`, mobile tap targets (48px), and reduced shadows on small screens per the design doc.
